  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.37 with immutable ProGPU preview.43; consumes optimized retained canvas-state routing and typed bitmap-flush clip rebasing without adding a bridge workaround; preserves the typed, reflection-free ProGPU media drawing-state bridge, native activation, deterministic popup-local input, transparent X11/XWayland visuals, and nonactivating windows; bounds retained render-resource caches and suppresses static-frame GPU rendering; and retains native Cocoa popups, Windows OLE clipboard, seven-theme, WPFGallery, and SharpDevelop designer acceptance gates.",
